# ==========================================================================
# WMSHEET.ww2 -- THE WW2 SET'S WEAPON CARDS.
#
# What each gun IS. How its parts MOVE is WMCARD.ww2, the reload lane's, measured off the mesh.
#
# DAMAGE, SPREAD, PELLETS AND FIRE TICS ARE BRUTAL WOLFENSTEIN'S OWN, read out of its
# Actors/Weaps/*.txt by RS_VR_Reload/tools/gen_ww2_set.py and written here by calling that same
# reader -- so the two cannot drift. Their numbers, our names, nothing invented. The owner's
# instruction, on their own private fork.
#
# THE AMMO TYPES ARE OURS AND ARE A JUDGEMENT, not a reading. Brutal Wolfenstein's own ammo
# classes -- WolfClip, MauserClip, M1CLIP, TGAMMO, PPSHReserve -- do not exist in our load order,
# and importing them would be importing their code, which is ruled out. Every gun is mapped onto
# Doom's own ammo so Doom's own pickups feed the set.
# ==========================================================================

gun "WW2_MP40"
  class
    slot               = 4
    selectionorder     = 9400
    ammo               = "Clip"
    hand               = main
    name               = "MP40"
    pickupmessage      = "MP40"
  end
  # Brutal Wolfenstein, Actors/Weaps/MP40.txt
  shotdamage           = 12, 12
  shotspread           = 5, 3
  firetics             = 1
end

